phase P8
title Benchmark and real-browser suites
description
    **Class:** not readily verifiable.

    **Kind:** verification-suite.

    **Goal:**

    - a proven benchmark suite (performance and bundle size on named devices) and a real-browser
      suite running the system inside the P6 apps in Chrome, Safari and an iOS simulator;
    - checked baselines from which the user sets the budget targets.

    **Starts when:** P6's apps run (P7 may run alongside only if it does not overlap).

    **Verified by:**

    - each suite run end to end, a deliberately slowed build caught per budget, tamper checks, and
      an audit by a lead that did not build it;
    - skill:check-benchmark on the baselines.

    **One iteration:** one suite part: build, prove with its slowed build or tamper, review.

    **Exit criteria:**

    - both suites proven, with coverage records;
    - baselines checked;
    - the user has set the budget targets.

    **False pass:** a benchmark that measures less work than the real path.

    **Caught by:** skill:check-benchmark comparing the work done.

    **Gates:** one slowed build per budget; tamper checks on the browser runs.

    **Budget:** the Epic's Budget section, row P8 and P9.

    **Failure limit:** 2.

    **Stops:** the budget targets, set by the user after the baselines.

    **User's read:** the proposed targets. Decisions: budget targets (the user), proposed by the
    orchestrator from the baselines.

    **Draws from:**

    - skill:policy-verification;
    - skill:check-benchmark;
    - skill:check-runtime;
    - skill:principle-explain-measurements.
tasks
    T35
        title       Benchmark and real-browser suites proven; baselines; targets
        status      draft
        priority    medium
        labels      [not-readily-verifiable, verification-suite]
        description
            Build both suites, prove them, take baselines on named devices, and propose targets for
            the user. Benchmarks and browser runs run alone. Drafted in full when P8 starts.

            - **Evidence:** this Task's comments.
            - **False pass:** skipped work in a benchmark → caught by skill:check-benchmark.
            - **Gates:** slowed builds; tamper checks.
            - **Budget:** 4 rounds.
            - **Stops:** the budget targets.
            - **User's read:** the proposed targets.
        acceptance
            Both suites killed their slowed builds and tampers; the user set the targets.
